<title>USA: Graff Pay-Per-View Inc Q3 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Graff Pay-Per-View Inc Q3 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.14	     loss $0.10</p>
<p> Net loss	  1,644	     loss 1,202</p>
<p> Revs		10,240		   12,527</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  11,340		   12,071</p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.31	     loss $0.12</p>
<p> Net loss	  3,470	     loss 1,432</p>
<p> Revs		30,894		   39,280</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary11,354		   11,713</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said the 1995 results were restated due to certain domestic and foreign satellite costs and start-up operating losses relating to a new European network.</p>
</text>
